# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   For an app, you may want to ignore it.
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in cases where you're working on something that relies on absolute paths, ignore it.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Poetry users generally store poetry.lock in version control.
#Poetry.lock

# pdm
#   PDM users generally store pdm.lock in version control
#pdm.lock

